{"@context":["https://litlfred.github.io/folio-assistant/ns/content/v1.jsonld",{"@base":"https://litlfred.github.io/folio/","folio-assistant-core":"https://litlfred.github.io/folio-assistant-core/v0/ns/"}],"@id":"papers/quantum-observable-universe/blocks/ex-irreducible-connection","@type":["folio-assistant-core:Example","doco:Section"],"label":"ex:irreducible-connection","kind":"example","title":"Irreducibility of the connection","uses":["papers/quantum-observable-universe/blocks/lem-categorical-irreducible","papers/quantum-observable-universe/blocks/ex-c-quantum-observable-universe"],"interprets":"papers/quantum-observable-universe/blocks/lem-categorical-irreducible","tags":["irreducibility","archimedean"],"leanRef":"qou:QOU.irreducible_connection","text":"irreducible-connection.md","leanSource":"irreducible-connection.lean","provenance":"authored","html":"<a id=\"ex:irreducible-connection\"></a><p>An instanton in the archimedean regime cannot reduce to an abelian <code class=\"language-math math-inline\">\\mathrm{U}(1)</code> sub-bundle. Its gauge orbit must remain free. This geometric fact specialises the categorical irreducibility axiom: every instanton connection <code class=\"language-math math-inline\">A</code> on <code class=\"language-math math-inline\">P</code> is irreducible.</p>\n<p>The vanishing cohomology <code class=\"language-math math-inline\">H^0(M, \\mathrm{Ad}(P)) = 0</code> provides the archimedean instance of <code class=\"language-math math-inline\">\\mathrm{Hom}_{\\mathbf{C}}(\\mathbf{1}, \\mathrm{Ad}(A)) = 0</code>. Concretely, a non-zero section <code class=\"language-math math-inline\">s \\in H^0(M, \\mathrm{Ad}(P))</code> furnishes an <code class=\"language-math math-inline\">\\mathrm{Ad}</code>-invariant direction in <code class=\"language-math math-inline\">\\mathfrak{su}(2)</code> at every point. This reduces the connection to <code class=\"language-math math-inline\">\\mathrm{U}(1)</code>. The QOU vanishing axiom forbids this, forcing the gauge orbit of <code class=\"language-math math-inline\">A</code> to be free.</p>\n","source":"folio/quantum-observable-universe/models-of-qous/irreducible-connection.md","heading":"Example","number":"5.5.4","page":"b/ex-irreducible-connection","qa":{"counts":{"pass":66,"fail":0,"warn":1,"na":7,"unknown":0,"stale":47},"milnor":{"total":2,"notPassing":0}},"lean":{"expected":true,"ref":"qou:QOU.irreducible_connection","via":"sibling","path":"folio/quantum-observable-universe/models-of-qous/irreducible-connection.lean","compiles":"unchecked","sorry":false,"sorryBasis":"text"}}
